      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think everyone knows you can't stop everyone from doing whatever they want in private instances.  I think the better use of time would be having a system that temporarily disables a public avatar if it recieves enough reports until it gets reviewed.  NSFW avatars should NOT be public and cloneable. Especially since they can't even enforce the rules to keep kids under 13 out of the game.",
