      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You should probably reword this to say\n! NSFW Avatars and Worlds.\n! NSFW behavior in Public worlds (Pubic, Friends+)\n! NSFW behavior streamed or shared from private worlds (Friends, Invite+, Invite)\nWhile NSFW worlds and avatars are banned, as far as I am aware, the community guidelines only specifically target NSFW behavior in public instances and shared media.",
