  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-12-04T17:53:38.869Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Most people who believe NSFW is allowed in VRChat reference the loading screen tip that covers it.  This is because it does not clarify that NSFW is not allowed in instances other than Public and Friends+.  People then assume it must mean it is allowed in the other instances, which it isn't.  So I think it should get a little edit that's uh more clear.  \nIll re-write the entire thing for ye!  Here's the script, starting from the very top:\nTHESE ACTIONS CAN LEAD TO BANS!\n! NSFW avatars, behavior, or content streamed or shared from ALL worlds (Public, Friends+, Friends, Invite+, Invite), NO exceptions \n! NSFW Avatars, behavior, or content in ALL worlds (Public, Friends+, Friends, Invite+, Invite), NO exceptions \n- I put the () with all the instances before I clarified \"NO exceptions\", because if it was after, people may think that the listed instances ARE the exceptions.",
